#### <<UC-USER-08_Update User Account>>

**ID and Name**
UC-USER-08 – Update User Account

**Primary Actor**
System Administrator

**Secondary Actor**
N/A

**Description**
As a **System Administrator**, I want to update an existing user account so that the user information remains accurate and up to date.

